+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in every build, development builds included, and this applies going forward. Local testing is done with self-signed certificates rather than by relaxing verification. HTTPS is used everywhere with no plaintext exception, since proper certificate management is now in place.
